-- because the sheet had neither a Post Date nor Internal Deadline for them.
--
-- Owner/Requester rule: Internal requirement rows -> Manish, Organic rows -> Satya
-- (resolved by email against profiles, so no hardcoded UUIDs). PM rows keep the
-- owner/requester already baked into their JSON below.
--
-- NOTE: REQ-006 (Individuial ads for Wise 8,HB+ for the display at hop): NO DATE in sheet — placeholder 2026-07-14 used, please fix in-app
-- NOTE: REQ-007 (Nutrition Quote (Hygiene post for Hop)): NO DATE in sheet — placeholder 2026-07-14 used, please fix in-app
