    ('REQ-009', '{"id": "REQ-009", "title": "AI achieveing peak health", "brief": "\"Slide 1 (Hook / Misdirection)\n\nThis is how AI helped me achieve my peak health.\nSwipe to check the 3 prompts that actually work.\n\nSlide 2 (Generate subhadeep''s image for this bit)\nWhy did you swipe? Seriously? AI is the \"\"Health Expert\"\" you go to?\n\nSlide 3\nAI can guide you.\nBut it can''t really know you.\n\nIt doesn''t know your body, your habits,\nor why you skip workouts on certain days.\nIt can give you answers-\nbut only if you ask the right questions.\nAnd most people don''t.\n\nSo before you rely on AI for your health,\nPut this workflow to your life\n\nSlide 3\nTake a step back and understand where you are right now.\n\nAsk yourself. What are you actually trying to improve?\nFat loss, strength, better energy, or just feeling less tired?\nBecause if the goal isn''t clear,\nnothing else will be.\n\nStart with something measurable, realistic, and personal to you.\n\n\"", "pipeline": "Organic", "status": "Design Progress", "requesterId": "10fdd038-55a0-4874-844f-3dea0c12145d", "ownerId": "10fdd038-55a0-4874-844f-3dea0c12145d", "assigneeIds": [], "followerIds": [], "reviewerIds": [], "postDate": "2026-07-14T00:00:00.000Z", "internalDeadline": "2026-07-14T00:00:00.000Z", "daysNeeded": 3, "rounds": [{"round": 0, "comments": [], "status": "pending", "submissionLinks": [], "submissionNote": ""}], "currentRound": 0, "attachments": [], "referenceLinks": ["https://www.instagram.com/p/DWtPbjHiPWk/?igsh=amd4dWd6ODJpNjF4"], "approvedAt": null, "approvedBy": [], "createdAt": "2026-07-14T00:00:00.000Z", "postDateHistory": [], "creatorRemovedFromApproval": false, "managerApproved": false, "founderApprovalRequired": false, "founderApproved": false, "activityLog": [], "postedBy": [], "assigneeAcceptance": [], "initiatedAt": null, "category": null}'::jsonb),
